msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A1F30229_A70F_4449_B9EA_47D4032BAEA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You were the only one to ever have pity for me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなただけが私を憐れんでくれたように……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9FA6C8F3_2B7D_4816_A931_950BCA707563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e8b9c19f4606e51f4238756ff088f0ce918b899cd51fccdc8a7969761396ee6
#. default-sha256: 81ac4e0b82f25a881e48b081bc267b9afefc9ba46d080628d912ab0d85d91ab9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9FA6C8F3_2B7D_4816_A931_950BCA707563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I shall do the same for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私だけがあなたの傍にいてあげましょう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ED94CB92_5964_46E6_9B5A_7065208EF56B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b498508422032dfd62bf625cdb884ceaa462c1551f672891a984eecd1509311
#. default-sha256: 99e2a5fbf246cfbce3f5595557dfb3a7635cb9b23376a1d3df8dde9394953ef2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ED94CB92_5964_46E6_9B5A_7065208EF56B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You can give me life again. You can resurrect me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなたの手によって――私は蘇ることが出来るのだから。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7F088681_CBC3_406F_B370_45C16AA79EFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8aa03e5663a0c6af631aec327e0bc006903f03264793a264fc782c62233a32a
#. default-sha256: 98a344f0b6de28812525ccc721a7d136fefcaf565ef57254d9eff1894990e55a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7F088681_CBC3_406F_B370_45C16AA79EFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It felt like I was no longer in control of my own body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her voice was tender in a "
"way unlike either Mother’s or Aimee’s."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫まるで、⟪k:1⟫自分の意志ではないようだった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫母とも、⟪k:4⟫エメとも違う優しげな、⟪k:5⟫"
"少女のような声が……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E693A7E3_F555_4086_BBE8_BDB52E3857CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f327c1888a6fd6b2ae1379428e08bab23b0a2484611ac0d9bfe74f4cf6ad0c81
