msgid "⟪k:0⟫Constant, everlasting despair..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫与え続けることが出来る……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2FA8154B_757D_40E8_B98D_4630AF243643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3864bcb9e8f07a879e2c752d22dd867800535dc37df6b23cf0f228715100e35
#. default-sha256: 07fc93888a2314b82acf4e94eaf6673951b41c05e46aee987b45704b50739aff
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2FA8154B_757D_40E8_B98D_4630AF243643"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Their flesh may turn to dust..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫たとえ彼らの肉体が朽ちたとしても……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D4E5927C_C209_48BF_A235_21727A0C5234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd43f61b6504ac3e556aee56528a7701f9982c624a107e346bc9f23a57e15ce8
#. default-sha256: 184d81a3242ff2037beef76bd5f3fe7991746ee28c549e2e470b557994cab7ef
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D4E5927C_C209_48BF_A235_21727A0C5234"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but so long as their souls live on, their torture will know no end..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魂の続く限り、⟪k:1⟫苦しみを与えられる……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D449F5C1_B1B1_4276_B37A_ADD7D10D46BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdb4b061620a22bef721e1c51f57703b3c7b5a0a1a33fc27b2b60b3351083fb8
#. default-sha256: 98d6439bf523057bf4d0f22c3939bdc82241a2125e4b3304e86966dbe81ebe26
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D449F5C1_B1B1_4276_B37A_ADD7D10D46BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tenderness in her voice crumbled away, leaving only raw loathing behind. ⟪k:1⟫She then "
"let out a half-muffled cackle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫儚い優しさを持っていたはずの声は、⟪k:1⟫憎しみに満ちたものへと変貌した。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そして、"
"⟪k:4⟫押し殺した笑い声が響き渡る。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9BCB69A7_9EEB_4A04_BAB8_2B40788CF6C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ede754dfeb21c82644c2174ef1135817b264e0a814e7a4575ce36a5d2acea5fa
#. default-sha256: 4ed8eaf0dac0b0a5d4de7d20dd1c89cb21ee49a0c1e2b3356eb07be6eab2554f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9BCB69A7_9EEB_4A04_BAB8_2B40788CF6C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Who ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お前は……⟪k:1⟫誰なんだ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E2088DD3_5F4E_4D55_B5A4_21971D01EB82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4668cb01b71fdb1319696cb0aebde2e9ec48285fae90e5b8b31c274cf8d0c9e5
#. default-sha256: 6a281ae1d1c6d60415c4e64f05974e148cc786ae5dec48451ebda841e2cb1d58
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E2088DD3_5F4E_4D55_B5A4_21971D01EB82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That I am.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am the cursed witch, who loathes this puny, wretched world—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫curses it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう……⟪k:1⟫私は呪われた魔女……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫このちっぽけな世界を憎み、⟪k:4⟫呪い続ける魔女……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B635749A_FC83_4FFC_A662_B0FD9832BB0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a0b1edc62f1e2f52f30ba29a2c9adad652d9970d50945d58406787a8c00e059
#. default-sha256: 9ac17fe4eda66ae4a4b4d2718c4840e918f04cff352a26992ba88afe6c3f80e7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B635749A_FC83_4FFC_A662_B0FD9832BB0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And my name is Morgana."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私の名はモルガーナ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_771B2BBE_68D4_4842_B6F4_FAF4FD301BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6de879d3acab86c3ecabddab946e62fd994c44ae081cbbc8db3086c913d0d9d
#. default-sha256: 67a4c4eb4c997c33ed06e5925fcbe7e280f344d9b6ff6dd5751efad5e37d512c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_771B2BBE_68D4_4842_B6F4_FAF4FD301BC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Morgana..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫モルガーナ………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_745E07C6_2877_4A93_BE88_6009A8257722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 954b53eb7493acd8edb0260a59ce4a0198d585cbb0b8f921b0afec48fea5e431
#. default-sha256: 17651979ae4e378a6b1a49c91432f87f4080438d7101b972400cc8d069e53bc2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_745E07C6_2877_4A93_BE88_6009A8257722"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could place a curse on someone you have a grudge against.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Drag them down into the "
"dark abyss."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたが憎いと思う人間を、⟪k:1⟫呪ってさしあげましょう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫光の見えない闇の底へ、⟪k:4⟫"
"転落させてやるのです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5591326A_723D_440F_BD0C_467CDB8381D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c27ddd21d0e9df474dcb22005b5380a0329456e1d6e0180068304e5b15a18a75
#. default-sha256: 3915d6d8bead1e894de008ec357c2e2f62291c681ba40a1dd241a346cb02dfdf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5591326A_723D_440F_BD0C_467CDB8381D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And for that, I will grant you your wish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫願いを聞いてあげる……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4965D32C_A833_4DA2_A2B2_72ED7724F309
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e951468dd2c4cd6cbaa5bcbd40e23689dc478441a1c49c5e31800c62ca67534
#. default-sha256: 7d50b77947df9008e711601194fd26877c0d1b62527520b576fb35790c9154d0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4965D32C_A833_4DA2_A2B2_72ED7724F309"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫if you remain steadfast in your desires, they will become reality,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫強い心を持ち、⟪k:1⟫願い続ければ……実現するのです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C9983542_4050_4C4B_8BDE_1D60BA4A957C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7453ee58c6bfd4ee69c6d69d1ec19520f36648100ad94f4b5721adab2f4f0941
